[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2846143719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2846143719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2846143719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ppLTn","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T02:10:01Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T02:13:21Z","body":"I recalled a bit late that you can store a `Vector`'s `ptrw()` early and avoid `_copy_on_write()` calls on each loop iteration. \r\n\r\nThe performance increase went from 5% to 9%.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2846143719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847062821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2847062821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2847062821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6psrsl","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T12:11:29Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T12:11:29Z","body":"> I tried to replace them with both LocalVector and TightLocalVector too, but the resulting performance was worse. I don't think this is a case where Vector is beaten by LocalVector.\r\n\r\nThere should not be a large difference between `Vector` and `LocalVector` in this case, although `LocalVector` should still be _slightly_ faster (perhaps not measurable).\r\nPerhaps you mixed up builds, or your computer had performance fluctuations when measuring?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847062821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847657584","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2847657584","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2847657584,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pu85w","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T16:41:12Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T16:41:12Z","body":"Most times I've played around with replacing `Vector`s with `LocalVector`s in the GDScript codebase resulted into a decrease in performance. This wasn't the first case. As I made #105555, I actually saw a performance increase, but as other PRs affecting either GDScript or other templates get merged, the improvement tends to turn into a performance loss and vice-versa.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847657584/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847668378","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2847668378","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2847668378,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pu_ia","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T16:47:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T16:47:13Z","body":"More often than not, it's difficult to see clear improvements because measuring can be very flaky! I'd recommend finding examples where the improvement is at least 20-30%. Otherwise, you can never be sure it's not just a measurement quirk.\r\n\r\nI _really_ would not expect `LocalVector` to fall behind `Vector` for _any_ operation other than copying, unless we're missing some obvious performance problem in there (that we should definitely patch if it was there) :)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847668378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847681869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2847681869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2847681869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pvC1N","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T16:55:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T16:59:28Z","body":"> More often than not, it's difficult to see clear improvements because measuring can be very flaky! I'd recommend finding examples where the improvement is at least 20-30%. Otherwise, you can never be sure it's not just a measurement quirk.\r\n> \r\n> I _really_ would not expect `LocalVector` to fall behind `Vector` for _any_ operation other than copying, unless we're missing some obvious performance problem in there (that we should definitely patch if it was there) :)\r\n\r\nThe only thing that I can think of would be if _somewhow_ indexing into LocalVector is slower. That would be very surprising though. But it seems like all this code does is fill a vector and then copy out of it element by element. \r\n\r\n@Ivorforce Any chance Vector provides an opportunity for moving memory while LocalVector does a full copy?\r\n\r\nAfter filling the Vector, this is all it is used for:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmsort.sort();\r\nfor (int i = 0; i < msort.size(); i++) {\r\n\tp_properties->push_back(E->get()->static_variables_indices[msort[i].name].property_info);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nand\r\n```\r\nfor (int i = 0; i < weak_subclasses.size(); i++) {\r\n\tClassRefWithName subclass = weak_subclasses[i];\r\n\tObject *obj = ObjectDB::get_instance(subclass.id);\r\n```\r\n\r\n~Maybe its the sort method?~ Sort appears to be the same for both","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847681869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848457533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2848457533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2848457533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pyAM9","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T06:09:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T06:09:36Z","body":"Profiling the bunnymark on an M2 MBP and I can't reproduce the performance increase. Additionally, when profiling, `GDScript::_get_script_property_list()` doesn't even appear suggesting that it doesn't have much of an impact on frame time","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848457533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849387172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2849387172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2849387172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p1jKk","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-04T19:50:41Z","updated_at":"2025-05-04T21:04:07Z","body":"Out of curiosity I decided to do another side-by-side comparison, because I reminded that the result at a low amount matters:\r\n\r\n1000 bunnies\r\n| branch           | average FPS |\r\n|------------------|-------------|\r\n| master           | 1088        |\r\n| PR (no ptrw)     | 1143        |\r\n| PR (with ptrw)   | 1110        |\r\n\r\n10000 bunnies\r\n| branch           | average FPS |\r\n|------------------|-------------|\r\n| master           | 109         |\r\n| PR (no ptrw)     | 127         |\r\n| PR (with ptrw)   | 118         |\r\n\r\nThen, just the PR versions:\r\n\r\n1000 bunnies\r\n| branch           | average FPS |\r\n|------------------|-------------|\r\n| PR (no ptrw)     | 1371        |\r\n| PR (with ptrw)   | 1294        |\r\n\r\n10000 bunnies\r\n| branch           | average FPS |\r\n|------------------|-------------|\r\n| PR (no ptrw)     | 131         |\r\n| PR (with ptrw)   | 127         |\r\n\r\nI was quite convinced that getting the pointer with `ptrw()` would be faster, but I after trying to repeat this process with similar resize + assign loops it turned out to actually slow things down, then I tested with this again and turns out the no pointer version is the one that actually wins.\r\n\r\nWill be reverting my force push, not only to get the best result, but also to be more in line with other cases of resize + assign.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849387172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849392353","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2849392353","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2849392353,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p1kbh","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-04T20:02:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-04T21:08:27Z","body":"> Profiling the bunnymark on an M2 MBP and I can't reproduce the performance increase. Additionally, when profiling, `GDScript::_get_script_property_list()` doesn't even appear suggesting that it doesn't have much of an impact on frame time\r\n\r\nI was just playing around with `push_back` loops that could be easily replaced with resize + assign (which should be considerably faster regardless), and only opened a PR because a performance increase happened on my build.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849392353/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849401733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998#issuecomment-2849401733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","id":2849401733,"node_id":"IC_kwDO